The '''Anvil Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Forges metal weapons and armor from smelted ingots.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.AnvilWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Anvil</code>.

